# CodeGraph: the index is local to each machine and rebuilt with `codegraph init`
# (see docs/AI_SETUP.md); codegraph.json at the repository root is shared and tracked.
# .codegraph-*/ covers alternative index dirs such as .codegraph-wsl/ (WSL on a Windows drive).
.codegraph/
.codegraph-*/
